You suddenly kick Yama-chan down and then tell us to get out of the way?!

02:37.547 --> 02:40.057
Say something you...

02:43.097 --> 02:45.067
Whoa, Toshirin's getting...

02:45.637 --> 02:46.807
This is bad!

02:46.807 --> 02:48.527
That's so messed up...

02:49.397 --> 02:50.857
Quit yakking!!

02:51.237 --> 02:54.327
All of you bastards, LOOK AT THAT!

02:56.647 --> 02:59.647
Question 1: What the hell is that?

02:59.647 --> 03:01.017
Yes, you in the middle!

03:03.497 --> 03:07.627
Um, uh, a tribute for the kid who died here recently...

03:07.627 --> 03:09.017
ABSOLUTELY RIGHT!

03:09.017 --> 03:10.427
Mit-chan!

03:10.877 --> 03:14.887
Okay then, why would that bottle have fallen over?

03:14.887 --> 03:20.097
Well, we were skateboarding and knocked it over...

03:20.097 --> 03:21.257
You bastards!

03:21.257 --> 03:22.557
I dare you to do that again!

03:23.177 --> 03:26.937
Or I'll make it so people have to lay flowers for you too!!

03:28.857 --> 03:31.247
We're so sorry!!

03:33.727 --> 03:36.867
If I scared them that badly, they probably won't come back here.

03:38.527 --> 03:41.827
I'll bring some new flowers for you tomorrow.

03:42.357 --> 03:44.837
Thanks for chasing them away.

03:44.837 --> 03:47.797
Now I can rest peacefully, Onii-chan.

03:50.287 --> 03:51.687
You're welcome.

03:53.207 --> 03:54.957
Hurry up and go to heaven.

03:56.137 --> 03:59.267
I'm Kurosaki Ichigo. 15 years old. High school freshman.

04:00.127 --> 04:01.637
My family runs the town clinic.

04:03.177 --> 04:06.307
We save and don't save lives.

04:06.927 --> 04:09.077
I dont know if that's why, but...

04:09.077 --> 04:14.087
...ever since I can remember, it's been normal for me to see ghosts.

04:17.217 --> 04:18.117
I'm home.

04:18.117 --> 04:19.987
YOU'RE LATE!!!

04:21.107 --> 04:22.807
You delinquent son!

04:22.807 --> 04:25.917
You know our dinner time is seven o'clock every night!

04:26.237 --> 04:31.487
Damn you, is that how you greet your son who went out of his way to help a ghost on the way home!?

04:31.487 --> 04:32.617
I don't wanna hear it!

04:32.617 --> 04:37.387
Only punishment awaits those who disrupt our family time, no matter what the reason is!

04:37.837 --> 04:43.347
Or what, are you bragging that you're the only one who can talk to and touch ghosts?!

04:43.347 --> 04:43.837
Shut up!

04:43.837 --> 04:46.157
I didn't ask for this power!

04:44.757 --> 04:46.797
Stop it you two.

04:46.797 --> 04:48.427
The food is getting cold.

04:48.427 --> 04:50.007
Let them be, Yuzu.

04:50.007 --> 04:50.827
More please.

04:50.827 --> 04:52.397
But Karin-chan...

04:55.887 --> 05:01.487
First of all, making a healthy male high school student come home at seven every night is unimagi-

05:01.487 --> 05:04.677
Ichi-nii, you've already got a new friend.

05:06.327 --> 05:08.067
What, when did you-?!

05:08.067 --> 05:10.727
I exorcise and exorcise and they keep coming, dammit!

05:10.727 --> 05:12.257
Thanks for the food.

05:13.537 --> 05:16.707
Ichi-nii has it rough being hi-spec.

05:16.707 --> 05:19.557
But you know, I'm kind of jealous.

05:19.557 --> 05:22.267
I can sense presences but almost never see them.

05:23.417 --> 05:26.697
I don't believe in ghosts and stuff, so...

05:27.547 --> 05:30.177
But you can see them too can't you?

05:30.177 --> 05:32.647
Dad's the only one who can't see them.

05:33.427 --> 05:37.357
Regardless if you see them or not, if you don't believe, then it's like they never existed.

05:39.147 --> 05:40.317
Thats cold!

05:42.607 --> 05:43.827
Dinner...

05:45.827 --> 05:47.827
Your guard was down!

05:54.827 --> 05:56.357
Forget it, I'm going to bed.

05:57.747 --> 05:59.057
Onii-chan!

06:00.707 --> 06:02.377
It's your fault, Dad.

06:02.377 --> 06:03.767
Why?!

06:07.467 --> 06:10.187
He's been having a tough time lately.

06:10.187 --> 06:14.147
Now that you mention it, he said he's seeing them a lot more lately.

06:14.147 --> 06:15.057
What?!

06:15.057 --> 06:17.967
He tells you two that kind of thing?!

06:17.967 --> 06:18.887
He didn't tell me...

06:18.887 --> 06:20.617
Of course not.

06:20.617 --> 06:26.577
Who'd talk to a father who's past forty and still communicates like a child...

06:27.067 --> 06:28.777
Oh Mother...

06:28.777 --> 06:32.607
Lately, maybe because of puberty, our daughters are being SO mean!

06:32.607 --> 06:34.527
What should I do?!

06:34.527 --> 06:37.607
First do something about that ridiculous poster.

06:40.077 --> 06:43.957
The scene is one block past Kamakura Station Blvd...

06:43.957 --> 06:45.787
And according to nearby residents...

06:45.787 --> 06:47.487
...at around 7:30 am...

06:47.487 --> 06:50.127
...with a loud shaking of the ground...

06:50.127 --> 06:52.967
...the faces of several buildings exploded.

06:52.967 --> 06:55.127
Fortunately, no injuries were reported, but...

06:54.137 --> 06:55.397
Morning,  Onii-chan.

06:55.397 --> 06:57.347
Morning. Where's Pop?

06:57.347 --> 06:58.677
He said a meeting.

06:58.677 --> 07:00.017
He won't be home tonight.

07:00.017 --> 07:01.407
I see... Oh.

07:01.627 --> 07:06.607
Currently, forensics and explosives experts have arrived and are investigating the cause.

07:06.607 --> 07:07.737
What's wrong?

07:07.737 --> 07:08.887
That's nearby.

07:22.747 --> 07:23.697
Hey!

07:30.467 --> 07:31.747
W-What was that sound?!

07:31.747 --> 07:34.037
Uh. I didn't hear anything.

07:35.227 --> 07:36.707
It's another explosion!!

07:46.097 --> 07:47.547
W-what's that?!

07:48.187 --> 07:49.247
Onii-chan!

07:49.827 --> 07:50.877
Run!

07:53.777 --> 07:54.777
What is that?

07:54.777 --> 07:55.727
Hell if I know!

07:58.617 --> 08:00.917
Hey! Hurry!

08:27.557 --> 08:29.237
H-Hey!

08:36.027 --> 08:37.167
Hey you!

08:36.567 --> 08:38.127
What the hell was that?

08:38.127 --> 08:39.867
Another explosion?

08:39.867 --> 08:41.017
Whats going on?

08:59.637 --> 09:01.397
I don't get it.

09:02.347 --> 09:03.997
Who was she...

09:16.737 --> 09:18.627
Who... are you?

09:23.327 --> 09:24.757
Who the hell are you?!

09:24.757 --> 09:25.787
What do you want?!

09:31.277 --> 09:32.467
Hey!

09:33.937 --> 09:34.887
It is near.

09:35.387 --> 09:37.277
Don't gimme, "It is near," dumbass!!

09:39.727 --> 09:42.387
You scare me shitless and then IGNORE me?!

09:42.387 --> 09:44.237
I asked you who the hell you are!

09:45.017 --> 09:48.117
You can see me?

09:48.117 --> 09:49.717
Rather, you kicked me...

09:51.057 --> 09:53.427
What bullshit are you talking?

09:53.867 --> 09:55.327
Of course I can see y-

09:55.327 --> 09:58.447
You are the boy who was in town earlier.

09:58.447 --> 09:59.887
You just realized it?

10:00.317 --> 10:01.487
This is strange...

10:01.487 --> 10:04.687
Ordinarily, no one should be able to see me.

10:05.997 --> 10:07.777
Quit talking that bullsh-

10:10.087 --> 10:11.497
Damn you...

10:11.497 --> 10:12.757
Very well, I shall tell you.

10:14.587 --> 10:17.097
I am a... Shinigami.

10:23.667 --> 10:25.147
Again? Where is it?

10:36.687 --> 10:37.677
I see.

10:37.677 --> 10:39.457
So basically, you're a Shinigami?

10:40.457 --> 10:46.087
And you came all the way from some place called "Soul Society" to vanquish evil spirits?

10:46.087 --> 10:49.587
Which means that monster earlier was one of those evil spirits?

10:49.587 --> 10:51.547
And it attacked that little girl?

10:52.157 --> 10:53.887
Okay I believe you...

10:53.887 --> 10:55.847
NO WAY I'LL BELIEVE THAT, DUMBASS!!

10:56.877 --> 11:02.087
You fool, you can see ghosts but you refuse to believe in the existence of a Shinigami?!

11:02.087 --> 11:03.307
Of course!

11:03.307 --> 11:07.427
Sorry but I've never ONCE seen a Shinigami before.

11:07.427 --> 11:09.777
I don't believe in things I can't see.

11:09.777 --> 11:11.877
You are seeing me right now.

11:12.687 --> 11:15.947
I'll accept that you ain't human.

11:15.947 --> 11:18.857
But go play Shinigami somewhere else

11:18.857 --> 11:21.287
Got that, you stupid brat?

11:22.027 --> 11:23.747
You just had to say it...

11:23.747 --> 11:25.147
Way of Binding, number 1!

11:26.117 --> 11:26.857
Sai!

11:30.967 --> 11:32.777
What the hell did you do?!

11:33.957 --> 11:34.987
You cannot move.

11:34.987 --> 11:35.677
Eh?!

11:35.677 --> 11:37.747
This is what is called "Way of the Demon"

11:37.747 --> 11:40.937
A noble magic that can only be used by a Shinigami.

11:40.937 --> 11:45.147
Despite how I look, I've lived nearly ten times as long as you.

11:45.147 --> 11:46.937
And you call me a "stupid brat?"

11:47.427 --> 11:49.247
Normally, I would eliminate you.

11:49.637 --> 11:54.197
But it just so happens that I am forbidden to harm people I am not ordered to.

11:54.197 --> 11:56.217
Be grateful, stupid brat.

11:56.947 --> 11:58.267
You bitch!

11:58.267 --> 11:59.217
And while I'm here...

12:08.157 --> 12:09.757
That guy from yesterday?!

12:09.757 --> 12:11.107
Please, no!

12:12.327 --> 12:14.467
I don't want to go to Hell.

12:14.917 --> 12:15.947
Do not be afraid.

12:16.537 --> 12:19.317
Your destination is not Hell.

12:19.317 --> 12:21.177
It is Soul Society.

12:21.177 --> 12:23.747
Unlike Hell, it is a relaxing place.

12:33.477 --> 12:35.607
What happened to that guy?

12:37.607 --> 12:39.797
I sent him to Soul Society.

12:40.227 --> 12:43.077
In your language, you would call it "going to Heaven."

12:43.897 --> 12:46.037
That's one of a Shinigami's jobs.

12:46.737 --> 12:51.397
So that even a brat like you will be convinced, I will be nice and draw it out for you.

12:53.157 --> 12:54.177
Listen closely.

12:54.177 --> 12:56.627
