13:09.477 --> 13:09.577
Bad Spirits

13:12.017 --> 13:14.077
Do you have any questions so far?

13:14.077 --> 13:18.657
Let's see, I'll start with why your drawings are so extremely bad.

13:22.577 --> 13:24.147
What the hell're you doing?!

13:24.147 --> 13:26.867
I will continue the explanation, your excellency Baron.

13:26.867 --> 13:27.757
Baron-?

13:27.757 --> 13:30.437
We Shinigamis have two jobs.

13:30.877 --> 13:35.337
One is to lead Pluses to Soul Society through the "Soul Burial" I just used.

13:30.877 --> 13:35.337
{=1}Konsoh

13:30.877 --> 13:35.337
{=0}Konsoh

13:33.067 --> 13:35.347
Soul Society

13:33.067 --> 13:35.347
Soul Society

13:35.337 --> 13:39.797
And the other is to kill Hollows and purify them.

13:35.337 --> 13:39.797
KAPOW!

13:35.337 --> 13:39.797
KAPOW!

13:35.337 --> 13:39.797
KAPOW!

13:35.337 --> 13:39.797
KAPOW!

13:35.337 --> 13:39.797
KAPOW!

13:35.337 --> 13:39.797
KAPOW!

13:39.797 --> 13:43.267
Why was a Hollow after that girl?

13:43.267 --> 13:44.657
I do not know that.

13:45.257 --> 13:49.927
Even we do not fully understand them.

13:58.557 --> 14:00.137
I smell it.

14:00.137 --> 14:04.427
The scent of an extraordinarily delicious soul.

14:05.857 --> 14:08.857
Along with the scent of a Shinigami.

14:08.857 --> 14:10.037
They are near.

14:18.797 --> 14:20.207
Hey, you hear that?!

14:20.207 --> 14:24.607
In any case, it is certain that the second one is roaming this area.

14:24.607 --> 14:27.267
Then hurry up and kill that second one!

14:28.757 --> 14:35.317
Well, I do not know why, but recently, I have not been able to sense its presence...

14:35.317 --> 14:38.937
...as if some huge power was hindering my senses.

14:38.937 --> 14:40.307
What the hell are you talking about?!

14:40.307 --> 14:42.427
Can't you hear its loud-ass voice?!

14:42.427 --> 14:44.277
Ain't that the monster?!

14:45.027 --> 14:46.567
Loud voice?

14:46.567 --> 14:47.927
When did it-

14:50.197 --> 14:51.127
I hear it!

14:52.217 --> 14:54.597
That was definetly the cry of a Hollow!

14:54.597 --> 14:55.167
See?!

14:57.127 --> 14:58.117
Yuzu?

14:58.117 --> 14:59.127
Hey wait!

15:02.127 --> 15:03.527
What spirit force!

15:03.927 --> 15:06.367
I could not sense this?!

15:06.367 --> 15:07.507
I...

15:08.007 --> 15:09.407
Onii-chan...

15:13.367 --> 15:14.457
Yuzu!

15:17.637 --> 15:18.527
Karin-chan...

15:19.307 --> 15:20.427
Onii-chan!

15:21.307 --> 15:25.157
Save... Karin-chan.

15:25.947 --> 15:27.477
Hey dammit!

15:30.907 --> 15:32.047
Hey!

15:32.047 --> 15:33.337
Dammit!

15:39.257 --> 15:41.027
Stop... Stop it!

15:46.407 --> 15:47.137
Get away!

15:48.587 --> 15:49.507
Karin!

15:49.927 --> 15:51.777
Dammit!!

15:53.177 --> 15:55.457
He is moving even under "Way of the Demon" magic?!

15:56.967 --> 15:57.677
You're in my way!

15:57.677 --> 15:58.797
Get back!

15:58.797 --> 15:59.567
Shut up!

16:03.027 --> 16:04.277
Karin!

16:07.117 --> 16:10.897
Don't! It could never be broken by human strength.

16:10.897 --> 16:13.097
If you force it, your soul will...

16:22.747 --> 16:25.607
A human dissolving Demon Magic on his own!

16:30.717 --> 16:31.807
Wait!!

16:34.187 --> 16:36.147
Ichi, run away!!!

16:41.677 --> 16:42.437
Karin!

16:42.437 --> 16:44.317
I found you.

16:55.817 --> 16:56.857
Karin!

16:56.857 --> 16:57.487
Hey!

16:57.487 --> 16:58.627
Do not panic.

16:59.527 --> 17:03.337
Your sisters' souls were not eaten by him.

17:03.337 --> 17:04.597
Really?

17:04.597 --> 17:05.677
Yes.

17:05.677 --> 17:09.407
He is seeking souls with high spiritual power.

17:10.917 --> 17:11.777
That is it...

17:12.587 --> 17:16.807
The Hollow from this afternoon was not after that girl.

17:17.217 --> 17:18.337
What do you...

17:18.337 --> 17:19.997
I do not know why...

17:19.997 --> 17:24.167
But until just now, your pulse was subdued to the lowest possible emission.

17:25.187 --> 17:31.717
so I did not sense anything from you, and no Hollows attacked you until now.

17:32.617 --> 17:37.207
It is just a guess, but the pulse that could not flow out of your body...

17:37.697 --> 17:42.627
...must have flowed out into the world when you touched that girl ghost.

17:43.527 --> 17:44.597
In other words...

17:44.597 --> 17:49.107
...those two Hollows followed the strength of your scent from that girl.

17:50.957 --> 17:52.887
They are all after you!

17:53.877 --> 17:56.237
They're... after me...

18:00.927 --> 18:01.637
It is here!

18:01.637 --> 18:02.387
You go-

18:02.387 --> 18:03.187
Shut up!

18:03.887 --> 18:07.097
You're saying that girl was attacked because of me?!

18:07.097 --> 18:08.157
What are you getting at...

18:08.157 --> 18:11.947
It's MY fault Karin and Yuzu are almost dying?!

18:11.947 --> 18:13.137
Save her..

18:14.157 --> 18:16.117
Ichi, run away!!

18:20.867 --> 18:25.877
Hey, you want my soul don't you?

18:26.707 --> 18:28.837
THEN COME FIGHT ME FOR IT!!!

18:52.017 --> 18:53.077
Shinigami!

18:56.067 --> 18:57.717
You fool...

19:00.037 --> 19:05.587
You should already know your strength is nothing against that...

19:06.447 --> 19:13.187
Or did you think it would all end smoothly if you just gave it your soul?

19:13.787 --> 19:18.247
At this rate, we are all just waiting to be it's prey.

19:28.017 --> 19:31.227
Do you want...to save your family?

19:32.227 --> 19:33.557
Of course.

19:34.227 --> 19:35.617
Is there a way?

19:36.567 --> 19:39.077
There is only one...

19:40.977 --> 19:43.537
You must become a Shinigami.

19:44.947 --> 19:48.587
Thrust this "Zanpakutou" through your heart...

19:48.587 --> 19:51.047
...and I will pour my powers into you.

19:53.747 --> 19:55.447
I do not know if this will work.

19:55.917 --> 19:58.217
But there is not any other way.

20:03.137 --> 20:05.647
Give me the sword, Shinigami.

20:06.307 --> 20:07.917
I am not "Shinigami."

20:08.517 --> 20:09.797
I am Kuchiki Rukia.

20:14.897 --> 20:15.947
I am...

20:17.607 --> 20:19.187
...Kurosaki Ichigo.

20:35.957 --> 20:37.097
Impossible...

20:38.997 --> 20:41.417
I intended to give only half my spirit power...

20:41.417 --> 20:43.707
But he took it all?

20:43.707 --> 20:45.017
Hey!

20:45.807 --> 20:47.227
Who is he?

20:48.637 --> 20:53.737
I have never seen a human with enough spirit force to confuse a Shinigami's senses.

20:55.157 --> 20:59.507
I have never seen a human who could break a Demon spell.

21:00.817 --> 21:08.127
And I have definitely never seen a Shinigami's zanpakutou become that HUGE!

21:11.487 --> 21:15.047
Feel my wrath for having raised a hand at my family...

21:15.047 --> 21:16.887
....AND GO TO HELL!!!

